[patient] okay
[doctor] okay so you're open to that
[patient] yeah i am
[doctor] okay and i'm gon na go ahead and i'm gon na order the naltrexone injection for you and we'll get you set up with that and i'll see you back in the office the week of june fourteenth to get that second injection and we'll follow up with you and see how you're doing with that and also with your blood pressure okay
[patient] okay
[doctor] okay so let's talk a little bit about your medical history i know that you have hypertension and hypercholesterolemia and i know that you have alcohol use disorder and i know that we're trying to address that today so can you tell me a little bit about your past medical history
