[doctor] okay so you're on the lisinopril twenty milligrams once a day and the hydrochlorothiazide twelve point five milligrams once a day and we're gon na continue you on those medications and we're gon na start you on the naltrexone injections and we'll follow up with you and see how you're doing with that and also with your blood pressure okay
