[doctor] okay. let's go ahead and take a look at your vitals. your blood pressure is 122 over 76. your heart rate is 82. your oxygen saturation is 95 percent on room air. let's go ahead and do a physical exam. i'm gon na start with your neck. does that hurt?
[patient] no, it doesn't hurt.
[doctor] okay. and your head, there doesn't appear to be any trauma. there's no ecchymosis or bruising. let's move on to your shoulder. i'm going to palpate your right shoulder. does this hurt?
[patient] yes, that hurts.
