[doctor] okay. well, greg, i'm going to go ahead and examine you now. i'm gon na start with your cardiovascular exam. your heart sounds normal, your lungs are clear. i'm gon na move on to your musculoskeletal exam. i'm gon na start with your right knee. when i push on the outside of your knee here, does it hurt?
