dialogue is: {{ [doctor] okay so i'm glad you're doing well i know you had a pretty significant heart attack last year and so i'm glad to see you're doing well i'm gon na tell you a little bit about my assessment and plan so for your first problem your coronary artery disease i know you had a heart attack last year i'm gon na put you on a heart healthy diet and i'm gon na refer you to cardiac rehab for some education and to gain confidence to resume exercising regularly so i know you were very upset when you had your heart attack and you stopped exercising and i know you're excited to get back to it but i want you to go slow and just take it one step at a time and i'm gon na give you a referral for cardiac rehab where they'll help you get back to exercising so for your second problem your newly reduced left ventricular dysfunction and moderate mitral regurgitation i know you had an echocardiogram that showed a low ejection fraction but i think your heart muscle is just stunned and i think it's going to improve over time so i'm gon na continue you on your lisinopril twenty milligrams a day and i'm gon na order another echocardiogram in about two months to see how you're doing and then for your third problem your heart failure i know you've been retaining a lot of fluid i'm gon na put you on lasix forty milligrams once a day and i'm gon na add aldactone twelve point five milligrams a day and i'm gon na order some blood work to see how you're doing and then for your hypertension your blood pressure is well controlled so i'm gon na continue you on the lisinopril twenty milligrams a day and i'm gon na refer you to a nutritionist to consider what other diet options might be available to you and for your last problem your type two diabetes i know your blood sugar is stable i'm gon na continue you on the metformin and i want you to keep monitoring your blood sugar levels so do you have any questions for me

[patient] no not at this time

[doctor] okay good all right thank you and i'll see you in two months

[patient] thank you }}<|eot_id|>
